# Prompt templates are byte-precise — Prettier's markdown printer would reformat
# bullets, code fences, and trailing whitespace, breaking buildTicketPrompt /
# buildFixPrPrompt's identical-output guarantee.
packages/cli/src/lib/prompts/templates/

# Design hand-off is vendor/reference content — README documents tokens and
# component anatomy, source/ is reference-only JSX. Reformatting bloats diffs
# and conflicts with future hand-off updates.
docs/designs/

# Skill-fixture snapshots are generated artifacts — verbatim copies of the
# `crew figma-snapshot` output (see docs/superpowers/skill-fixtures/). They must
# byte-match the generator so the visual-fidelity-check skill reads identical
# data from the fixture and from `.crew/figma-snapshot/`. Prettier reformatting
# the JSON would diverge the copy from its source. Hand-authored fixture files
# (description.md, expected/, runs/) outside snapshot/ stay checked.
docs/superpowers/skill-fixtures/**/snapshot/
